<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Telecasters year net profit surges.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Telecasters year net profit surges.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    13.38 vs  7.08</p>
<p>    Net					8.57 vs  2.11</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    12.0  vs   6.0</p>
<p>Note: Telecasters Australia Ltd is a regional television broadcaster.</p>
</text>
